                                                "sense_id": "0f433e36-2868-3f69-848d-310c33d99749",
                                                "text": "For a time, it was the only Royalist stronghold between London and Exeter, but it fell at last when a member of the garrison turned traitor and admitted the Parliamentary besiegers who destroyed it with gunpowder."
                                            }
